# Minimal RADIUS attribute dictionary for the PNetLab external-auth client
# (broker verb extauth_verify). Only the attributes the PAP Access-Request /
# Access-Accept exchange actually uses are defined; unknown attributes in a
# reply are kept by numeric id and ignored. Formats follow RFC 2865.
ATTRIBUTE	User-Name		1	string
ATTRIBUTE	User-Password		2	string
ATTRIBUTE	NAS-IP-Address		4	ipaddr
ATTRIBUTE	Service-Type		6	integer
ATTRIBUTE	Filter-Id		11	string
ATTRIBUTE	Reply-Message		18	string
ATTRIBUTE	Class			25	octets
ATTRIBUTE	Session-Timeout		27	integer
ATTRIBUTE	NAS-Identifier		32	string
ATTRIBUTE	Message-Authenticator	80	octets
